  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Real name Angelina Ajimu, she was a transporter responsible for delivering intelligence and special cargo around Siracusa. \nAs an apprentice caster Operator, she now provides logistical support, battlefield assistance, and tactical coordination for Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "安洁莉娜，本名安心院安洁莉娜。于叙拉古从事情报递送、货物运输等公开活动，推测身份：信使。\n现作为实习术师干员，为罗德岛提供后勤保障、战场辅助与战术协同等服务。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 5% \nThe infection is consistently spreading. Regular observation and control are required. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.31u/L \nSubject has both visible crystallization and other symptoms of Oripathy. Although her condition is not serious, Angelina must keep to a course of treatment.\n—Medic Operator Warfarin",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】5% \n以这个势头发展下去，感染将匀速蔓延扩散。需要保持定期观察与控制。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.31u/L\n包括体表的源石结晶在内，干员安洁莉娜有着非常明显的感染者症状，虽然说不上有多严重，但安洁莉娜小姐可也千万不能轻视病况呀。\n——医疗干员华法琳",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "She may not realize it, but Angelina has a special knack for Arts! She can change how much an object weighs. I think if she gets the proper training, she could be amazing one day!",
        "zh": "虽然安洁莉娜她自己没意识到，不过她可是有着相当独特的法术天赋的哦！好像，是能让各种物品，变重或者是变轻的样子……如果能得到进一步的引导和开发的话，我觉得，总有一天她会变得很了不起的！",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Having only just recently become a transporter, Angelina is full of hope for the future, much like other high schoolers. She spends much of her time studying or dressing up. \nShe likes dainty jewelry and young adult novels, and hides a secret love for older music. She could enjoy an ordinary, happy life. \n\nWhen Rhodes Island sought her out, she was gliding between skyscrapers in the middle of a dark night.",
        "zh": "刚成为信使不久的少女。安洁莉娜就像其他的高中生一样，对未来充满希望，但也花了很多时间在学业与打扮上。\n喜欢小饰品和流行小说，意外的喜欢稍显复古的音乐，安洁莉娜的人生本应平常而快乐。\n\n而当罗德岛寻访她时，安洁莉娜却正穿梭在城市的黑夜中，于大楼间轻巧地滑翔而过。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The world is unfair. \nAfter she suffering her infection, Angelina quietly faded from her old life. \nShe didn't linger or say her goodbyes. She just silently left her family, friends, and beloved hometown behind. \nYet she had not resigned herself to the typical fate of an Infected. \nEvery night, she ran, jumped, glided between buildings, practiced her Arts, and smuggled goods from one place to another. \nAs a courier, an Infected, or just a normal high-schooler, Angelina works hard, no matter what the future may look like.",
        "zh": "这片大地是不公的。\n意外成为感染者的安洁莉娜，悄悄地从自己的生活中消失了。\n没有告别，没有徘徊，安洁莉娜离开了家庭，默默地告别了学校中的朋友和自己热爱的故乡。\n然而，即便已经知晓了感染者的结局，安洁莉娜却并不甘心。\n每个夜晚，她奔跑着，跳跃着，在建筑间穿梭着，操纵着还不那么熟练的法术，将货物从一个秘密的地方运送到另一个秘密的地方。\n作为信使，作为感染者，也作为一个普通的高中生，安洁莉娜正在努力地生活下去，无论未来会变成什么模样。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Before she came to Rhodes Island and met the Doctor, Angelina kept these secrets hidden away in her heart. \nIt wasn't until Rhodes Island found her that she knew there was another life for the Infected. She is now a Rhodes Island Operator, and she may be able to go back to school. \nProbably. \nWhere will the path Angelina has chosen take her? \nEven she can't imagine.",
        "zh": "在遇见罗德岛与博士之前，安洁莉娜将这些秘密都藏在自己心里。\n直到罗德岛发掘了安洁莉娜，她才看见了另一种属于感染者的生活。而她，也给罗德岛带来了不同的色彩。如今成为了罗德岛干员的她，兴许也能重新找回自己作为一个高中生应有的生活。\n……大概。\n安洁莉娜选择的道路，究竟会通向哪里？\n可能连她自己都没法想象吧。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
